  "conservation_statement": "After this painting was stabilized for display in the Japanese art gallery (235B) in 2018, it was decided that during the time between display periods it would receive a more intensive treatment to fully repair issues with delamination, wear throughout the mounting silks, and splits at the edges of the scroll. Between 2020 and 2022, the hanging scroll was dismantled, the painting treated, and the whole remounted reusing the old mounting silks and hanging scroll hardware.",
